283
00:23:53,984 --> 00:23:56,365
[SPEAKER_04]: And then you... you didn't act out of it, obviously.

284
00:23:56,825 --> 00:23:57,645
[SPEAKER_04]: You refuse to look.

285
00:23:58,066 --> 00:23:59,786
[SPEAKER_04]: So, you restrain your senses.

286
00:23:59,806 --> 00:24:03,088
[SPEAKER_04]: And now there's that pressure of...

287
00:24:03,108 --> 00:24:03,768
[SPEAKER_04]: So, what do you do then?

288
00:24:11,723 --> 00:24:13,164
[SPEAKER_00]: As in, continue to not actually...

289
00:24:15,045 --> 00:24:16,526
[SPEAKER_04]: So, how long?

290
00:24:17,207 --> 00:24:17,887
