00:24:53,088 --> 00:24:55,249
[SPEAKER_00]: Can I, can I do this or can I do that?

302
00:24:56,189 --> 00:25:00,970
[SPEAKER_00]: It's, it's like, all, anybody would be asking those kind of questions

