[SPEAKER_04]: But how far can you go?

309
00:25:12,526 --> 00:25:13,967
[SPEAKER_04]: How far can you allow yourself to go?

310
00:25:15,508 --> 00:25:21,451
[SPEAKER_04]: So, you know, trying to... like, yeah, pressure is unpleasant and craving against it is already there, because you're suffering, obviously.

311
00:25:22,191 --> 00:25:23,832
[SPEAKER_04]: So, you cannot just not do that.

312
00:25:24,473 --> 00:25:25,333
[SPEAKER_04]: Eventually, you can.

