00:25:26,434 --> 00:25:28,535
[SPEAKER_04]: So, now, I'm trying to just

314
00:25:29,891 --> 00:25:39,117
[SPEAKER_04]: Clarify or talk about what is the practical extent of what I can do on account of pressure that I'm affected, mistakenly, through my wrong views, through my craving.

