00:25:41,299 --> 00:25:44,861
[SPEAKER_04]: Can I go to another room or to another place?

316
00:25:47,643 --> 00:25:48,904
[SPEAKER_04]: Can I then read something?

317
00:25:49,365 --> 00:25:50,305
[SPEAKER_04]: Can I then go to sleep?

318
00:25:51,126 --> 00:25:52,687
[SPEAKER_04]: Can I then go for a walk?

