[SPEAKER_03]: If that is not done, like we said, as trying to manage the problem... No, no, no.

330
00:26:18,988 --> 00:26:19,408
[SPEAKER_03]: It is.

331
00:26:19,608 --> 00:26:19,888
[SPEAKER_03]: It is.

332
00:26:19,968 --> 00:26:21,588
