00:26:49,416 --> 00:26:50,697
[SPEAKER_04]: Why can't you go to another room?

342
00:26:50,717 --> 00:26:51,957
[SPEAKER_04]: Because you're acting out of craving.

343
00:26:52,357 --> 00:26:54,438
[SPEAKER_04]: But why can't you just watch your nostrils and calm down?

344
00:26:54,478 --> 00:26:55,478
[SPEAKER_04]: Because you're acting out of craving.

