00:26:58,640 --> 00:26:59,880
[SPEAKER_04]: What's the difference between the two?

346
00:27:02,062 --> 00:27:12,547
[SPEAKER_03]: I would say the first... like, if something is overwhelming to the point where it might make you act out of it, it's better to remove yourself.

347
00:27:12,767 --> 00:27:15,769
