348
00:27:15,789 --> 00:27:19,170
[SPEAKER_04]: ...is basically acting out of it already.

349
00:27:19,891 --> 00:27:20,291
[SPEAKER_04]: Exactly.

350
00:27:20,631 --> 00:27:24,053
[SPEAKER_04]: So, the first one has the imminent danger of losing the sensory strength.

351
