00:27:36,880 --> 00:27:38,741
[SPEAKER_04]: Now, you just don't want to bear the discomfort of it.

355
00:27:38,921 --> 00:27:43,063
[SPEAKER_04]: So, you watch your nostrils to come, or read a book, or go to sleep, or chant, or whatever you do.

356
00:27:43,984 --> 00:27:45,185
[SPEAKER_03]: See, now that's overdoing it.

357
00:27:45,405 --> 00:27:47,426
[SPEAKER_04]: Because there is no more imminent danger yet.

358
00:27:47,506 --> 00:27:49,567
[SPEAKER_04]: So, when there is imminent danger, avoid it.

359
00:27:50,736 --> 00:27:58,020
[SPEAKER_04]: Yes, it's rooted in craving, but at least you won't, like, undermine yourself to a significant degree.

360
