00:28:27,043 --> 00:28:28,724
[SPEAKER_04]: No, there is nothing to look here.

368
00:28:29,665 --> 00:28:33,347
[SPEAKER_04]: Okay, so now the pain of it has to be endured on the level of the mind, that pressure.

369
